{"uid":"24b58fe31dd81ddc","name":"test_run_list_and_detail_render_the_approach_denominator","fullName":"tests.test_browser_hub#test_run_list_and_detail_render_the_approach_denominator","historyId":"87e93a63bd3206eb182fbe5d1a8db31b","time":{"start":1792157945382,"stop":1792157970361,"duration":24979},"description":"Task 008 (#16): the browser half of the approach counter.\n\n    #16's complaint is that `approach 2` alone says nothing about how much of\n    the review ladder is left, so both hub surfaces must show `n/m` -- the\n    run-list APPROACH cell and the run-detail summary row -- rendered from the\n    string the server formatted with the one shared formatter\n    (`engine.state.format_approach`, via `ui_server._with_approach_display`),\n    never a second JS spelling of it.\n\n    All three honest renderings are asserted from an ON-DISK snapshot with no\n    container at all (the state in which an operator most often reads these\n    pages): `10/12`, a bare `2` where the run dir records no `maxApproaches`,\n    and an empty cell for a run that never entered the ladder -- never `/3`.\n\n    The column must also still sort on the raw numerator: the fixtures are\n    picked so a string sort of the rendered cells (\"10/12\" < \"2/3\") puts\n    approach 10 in the wrong place.\n    ","descriptionHtml":"<p>Task 008 (#16): the browser half of the approach counter.</p>\n<pre><code>#16's complaint is that `approach 2` alone says nothing about how much of\nthe review ladder is left, so both hub surfaces must show `n/m` -- the\nrun-list APPROACH cell and the run-detail summary row -- rendered from the\nstring the server formatted with the one shared formatter\n(`engine.state.format_approach`, via `ui_server._with_approach_display`),\nnever a second JS spelling of it.\n\nAll three honest renderings are asserted from an ON-DISK snapshot with no\ncontainer at all (the state in which an operator most often reads these\npages): `10/12`, a bare `2` where the run dir records no `maxApproaches`,\nand an empty cell for a run that never entered the ladder -- never `/3`.\n\nThe column must also still sort on the raw numerator: the fixtures are\npicked so a string sort of the rendered cells (&quot;10/12&quot; &lt; &quot;2/3&quot;) puts\napproach 10 in the wrong place.\n</code></pre>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"tmp_path_factory","time":{"start":1792157639033,"stop":1792157639033,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1792157639033,"stop":1792157639033,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_isolate_ambient_home_in_process","time":{"start":1792157945380,"stop":1792157945380,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_scrub_notifier_env_in_process","time":{"start":1792157945380,"stop":1792157945381,"duration":1},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_isolate_ambient_task_record_dir","time":{"start":1792157945380,"stop":1792157945380,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"monkeypatch","time":{"start":1792157945380,"stop":1792157945380,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsC